20:18\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(1,20,18)\">Gen 20:18</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), compare absolute <ref ref=\"Isa 66:9\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,9)\">Isa 66:9</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>מוֺלִיד</bdbheb>); followed by infinitive <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:24\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,24)\">2Kgs 4:24</ref> with accusative of person alone <ref ref=\"1Kgs 18:44\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"44\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"44\" onclick=\"bcv(11,18,44)\">1Kgs 18:44</ref> <highlight>hinder, stop</highlight>; with accusative of sky (hindering rain) <ref ref=\"Deut 11:17\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,17)\">Deut 11:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 7:13\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(14,7,13)\">2Chr 7:13</ref> passive participle absolute <highlight>shut up</highlight>, or <highlight>hindered</highlight> (for reasons not given) <ref ref=\"Jer 36:5\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(24,36,5)\">Jer 36:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 6:10\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(16,6,10)\">Neh 6:10</ref> (? by a vow, or by ceremonial uncleanness, compare Rs<sup>Sem i. 436 f., 2nd ed. 455 f.</sup>); = <highlight>shut up</highlight> (with <bdbheb>ב</bdbheb>, in prison) <ref ref=\"2Kgs 17:4\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(12,17,4)\">2Kgs 17:4</ref>, passive participle <ref ref=\"Jer 33:1\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(24,33,1)\">Jer 33:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 39:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"39\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"39\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,39,15)\">Jer 39:15</ref>, figurative <ref ref=\"Jer 20:9\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(24,20,9)\">Jer 20:9</ref> on <bdbheb>עָצוּר וְעָזוּב</bdbheb> (5 t.) see I.  <bdbheb><reflink>עזב</reflink></bdbheb>; <bdbheb>עֲצֻרָה לָנוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 21:6\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(9,21,6)\">1Sam 21:6</ref> women have been <highlight>kept away</highlight> with reference to us (compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('RS')\">RS<sup>l.c</sup></lookup>.); <bdbheb>עָצוּר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>מִפְּנֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 12:1\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(13,12,1)\">1Chr 12:1</ref> <highlight>kept away from before</highlight> Saul; = <highlight>detain</highlight>, with accusative <ref ref=\"Judg 13:15\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,15)\">Judg 13:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 13:16\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(7,13,16)\">Judg 13:16</ref> in Job with <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>בְּמִלִּין</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 4:2\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(18,4,2)\">Job 4:2</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Job 29:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,9)\">Job 29:9</ref>, so <bdbheb>בַּמַּיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 12:5\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(18,12,5)\">Job 12:5</ref> <bdbheb>בְּעַמִּי</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 9:17\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(9,9,17)\">1Sam 9:17</ref> is <highlight>rule over</highlight>, etc. (si vera lectio); insert also (with other words) <ref ref=\"1Sam 10:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,1)\">1Sam 10:1</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('We')\">We</lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\